### Groups API Testing
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000
### Authentication: Token-based

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = 9452db2d6edc004c7e1d2794f1cbbb2e8af9b968

### 1. Get all groups (List View)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Create a new group
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Python Programming Group",
    "teachers": [],
    "current_course": null,
    "current_lesson": null
}

###

### 3. Get a specific group by ID (with all lesson data)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/7/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. Update a group with course and lesson
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Advanced Python Programming Group",
    "teachers": [1],
    "current_course": 1,
    "current_lesson": 1
}

###

### 5. Partially update a group (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "current_lesson": 2,
    "last_taught_date": "2025-09-15T10:00:00Z"
}

###

### 6. Get group with course lessons data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 7. Create group with teachers
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "JavaScript Fundamentals Group",
    "teachers": [1, 2],
    "current_course": 2
}

###

### 8. Update group to set current lesson
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/2/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "current_lesson": 3
}

###

### 9. Delete a group
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/2/
Authorization: Token {{token}}

###

### 10. Test group with invalid data (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "",
    "teachers": []
}

###

### 11. Create minimal group
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/
Authorization: Token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Basic Programming Group"
}

###

### 12. Get group without authentication (should fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/
Content-Type: application/json

###

