### Notes:
### - Replace {{token}} with actual authentication token
### - Replace group IDs (1, 2) with actual group IDs from your database
### - Replace teacher IDs (1, 2) with actual teacher IDs from your database
### - Replace course IDs (1, 2) with actual course IDs from your database
### - Replace lesson IDs (1, 2, 3) with actual lesson IDs from your database
### - The lessons_data will only show lessons from the current_course
### - current_lesson_info includes course_title and last_taught information
### - Groups can be created without courses/lessons and updated later